# The built binary, not the command's source: a bare "splint" matches the
# directory cmd/splint too, and hides the whole command from git.
/splint
go-fsck.json
splint.json
.profile/
# The coverage profile the test job writes.
pkg.cov

# The formatter fixture as `atkins fix` writes it. testdata/input is the
# source and testdata/golden is what it should come out as; this is the copy
# in between, kept for reading a change by eye.
/linters/imports/testdata/output/
